OL,6,FWhen parenting advice becomes too much
OL,8,FBefore Rosie Whitfield became a mum,
OL,9,Fshe imagined herself parenting very
OL,10,Fcalm children.
OL,12,F"Then I had two wild boys," she says
OL,13,Fwith a laugh.
OL,15,FFollowing the birth of her kids, Rosie
OL,16,Fspent hours online looking for the best
OL,17,Fadvice and was drawn to one particular
OL,18,Fapproach to parenting: Gentle
OL,19,Fparenting, which focuses on empathy and
OL,20,Fmutual respect with little emphasis on
OL,21,Fpunishment, albeit with boundaries.
